\subsection{BTC}

16 retrospective consensus alert run(s) were flagged on the daily clock. The first listed run begins on 2021-01-02. The SDFC candidate is 2018-12-16 with t-statistic 1.51. SADF peaks on 2021-01-08, the two-sided CSW heuristic peaks on 2020-03-12, and the SMT score peaks on 2025-10-09.

\begin{figure}[H]
\centering
\includegraphics[width=0.98\textwidth]{regime_chapter_figs/fig_asset_BTC.pdf}
\caption{BTC structural-break diagnostics. Orange shading is retrospective consensus, not an online trading signal.}
\end{figure}

